---
import { generateGeneralInquiryUrl } from '../../utils/whatsapp';

const waUrl = generateGeneralInquiryUrl('home-rfq-banner');
---

<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-[#090b10] text-white border-t border-slate-800/80 font-sans select-none">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left: Information Checklist (Apple Engineering Spec) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 block mb-3">
          KONSULTASI &amp; ESTIMASI TEKNIS
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Konsultasikan Equipment Industri Anda
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-400 mt-4 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          Sampaikan anomali atau kebutuhan perawatan motor, generator, transformer, atau balancing tunnel Anda. Tim engineer MESINDO TEKNISIA siap memberikan analisis awal dan estimasi penawaran teknis.
        </p>

        <!-- Information checklist required -->
        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/[0.1]">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 block mb-3">
            Parameter pendukung untuk mempercepat estimasi teknis:
          </span>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-400 shrink-0"></span>
              <span>Foto Nameplate Motor / Generator</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-400 shrink-0"></span>
              <span>Power (kW / HP / MW) &amp; RPM</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-400 shrink-0"></span>
              <span>Tegangan Kerja (Voltage) &amp; Hz</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-400 shrink-0"></span>
              <span>Keluhan (Vibrasi, Panas, Winding)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-400 shrink-0"></span>
              <span>Nomor / Tipe Bearing</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-400 shrink-0"></span>
              <span>Lokasi Pabrik / Site Industri</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Direct RFQ Action Panel (Zero Nested Card) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 border-t lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l border-white/[0.1] lg:pl-12 pt-8 lg:pt-0 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 block mb-1">
            ESTIMASI PENAWARAN RESMI
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white tracking-tight leading-snug">
            Permohonan Penawaran Harga (RFQ)
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Gunakan formulir online kami untuk menginput rincian unit secara terstruktur, atau hubungi hotline teknis kami untuk respon darurat 24/7.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3 pt-4 border-t border-white/[0.1]">
          <a
            href="/request-quotation/"
            class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-3.5 px-6 rounded-sm bg-white hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-950 font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-tight transition-all shadow-md"
          >
            <span>Isi Formulir Request Quotation</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>

          <!-- Authorised Single WhatsApp CTA: Secondary style with monochrome icon per preferences.md -->
          <a
            href={waUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-3 px-6 rounded-sm bg-white/[0.06] hover:bg-white/[0.12] text-slate-200 hover:text-white border border-white/[0.15] font-medium text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-tight transition-all"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current text-slate-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12.04 2c-5.46 0-9.91 4.45-9.91 9.91 0 1.75.46 3.45 1.32 4.95L2.05 22l5.25-1.38c1.45.79 3.08 1.21 4.74 1.21 5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91 0-2.65-1.03-5.14-2.9-7.01A9.816 9.816 0 0012.04 2z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Konsultasi Hotline WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500">
          Melayani pekerjaan workshop di 10 cabang serta pekerjaan on-site di seluruh Indonesia.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
